        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Vaughn, Bert Kaempfert\n- Works: “A Swingin' Safari”\n- Topics: chart performance, music careers\n\nFacts:\n- In 1923, Berthold Heinrich Kämpfert was born on 16 October.\n- Bert Kaempfert was the better-known name of Berthold Heinrich Kämpfert.\n- Bert Kaempfert was a German orchestra leader, music producer, and songwriter.\n- In the same year referenced on the page for “A Swingin' Safari,” Billy Vaughn recorded “A Swingin' Safari.”\n- In that summer, Billy Vaughn’s cover of “A Swingin' Safari” reached number 13 on the Billboard charts.\n- Bert Kaempfert died on 21 June 1980.",
